  "result": "Perfect! All 104 tests pass \u2705\n\n**Date utilities are fully integrated:**\n\n**Created src/dates.js with UTC-only date handling:**\n\n**isValidDate(text)** \u2014 Validates YYYY-MM-DD format and actual dates\n- Rejects invalid formats: `'2026/10/07'`, `'2026-10-7'`\n- Rejects fake dates: `'2026-02-30'`, `'2023-02-29'`\n- Accepts leap years: `'2024-02-29'` \u2713\n\n**addDays(date, n)** \u2014 Add/subtract days in UTC\n```javascript\naddDays('2026-10-07', 1)    // \u2192 '2026-10-08'\naddDays('2026-10-31', 1)    // \u2192 '2026-11-01' (month wrap)\naddDays('2026-12-31', 1)    // \u2192 '2027-01-01' (year wrap)\naddDays('2026-10-07', -10)  // \u2192 '2026-09-27' (negative)\n```\n\n**daysBetween(a, b)** \u2014 Calculate b - a in whole days (UTC)\n```javascript\ndaysBetween('2026-10-07', '2026-10-17')  // \u2192 10\ndaysBetween('2026-10-17', '2026-10-07')  // \u2192 -10\ndaysBetween('2026-12-31', '2027-01-01')  // \u2192 1\n```\n\n**Updated createInvoice** \u2014 Uses isValidDate for cleaner date validation\n\n**Test coverage (20 date tests):**\n- Valid/invalid formats\n- Fake dates and leap year handling\n- Adding days (positive, negative, zero)\n- Month/year wrapping\n- Day difference calculations\n- Edge cases across boundaries\n\n**Key design:**\n- All dates are `'YYYY-MM-DD'` strings\n- All arithmetic in UTC (never local timezone)\n- Whole-day arithmetic only (no time components)",
